#: r2/lib/strings.py:152
msgid "This page shows a history of recent activity on your account. If you notice unusual activity, you should change your password immediately. Location information is guessed from your computer's IP address and may be wildly wrong, especially for visits from mobile devices."
msgstr "Din il-paġna turi l-istorja tal-attività reċenti fil-kont tiegħek. Jekk tinnota attività mhux tas-soltu, għandek tbiddel il-password tiegħek minnufih. L-informazzjoni dwar il-post hija stmata mill-indirizz IP tal-kompjuter tiegħek u tista' tkun żbaljata ħafna, speċjalment għal żjarat minn apparat mowbajl."

