#: r2/lib/strings.py:160
msgid "Below you will see your promotion's impression and click traffic per hour of promotion.  Please note that these traffic totals will lag behind by two to three hours, and that daily totals will be preliminary until 24 hours after the link has finished its run."
msgstr "Hawn taħt tara l-impressjonijiet u l-klikks tal-promozzjoni tiegħek għal kull siegħa tal-promozzjoni. Jekk jogħġbok innota li dawn it-totali tat-traffiku jaslu b'dewmien ta' sagħtejn sa tliet sigħat, u li t-totali ta' kuljum huma preliminari sa 24 siegħa wara li l-link ikun spiċċa."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:161 r2/lib/strings.py:162
msgid "Traffic is counted as pages are viewed, and these graphs update every few minutes."
msgstr "It-traffiku jingħadd hekk kif il-paġni jiġu mwarrba, u dawn il-graffs jiġu aġġornati kull ftit minuti."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:163
#, python-format
msgid "Questions? Email self serve support: %(email)s"
msgstr "Għandek xi Mistoqsijiet? Ibgħat email lis-sistema ta' support self service: posta elettronika%(email)s"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:165
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Below are the traffic statistics for your vault. Each graph represents one of the following over the interval specified.\n"
"\n"
"* **pageviews** are the pages people viewed in %(vault)s, including both listing pages and comment pages (not bots, feeds or the API).\n"
"* **uniques** are how many different people made those pageviews: each logged-in member counts once, and each logged-out visitor once per address and browser.\n"
"* **subscriptions** is the number of new subscriptions that have been generated in a given day. This number is less accurate than the first two metrics, as, though we can track new subscriptions, we have no way to track unsubscriptions.\n"
"\n"
"Note: there are a couple of places outside of your vault where someone can click \"subscribe\", so it is possible (though unlikely) that the subscription count can exceed the unique count on a given day.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Hawn taħt hemm l-istatistika tat-traffiku għall-vault tiegħek. Kull graff jirrappreżenta waħda minn dawn li ġejjin matul l-intervall speċifikat.\n"
"\n"
"* **pageviews** huma l-paġni li n-nies raw f'%(vault)s, inklużi l-paġni tal-listi u l-paġni tal-kummenti (mhux bots, feeds jew l-API).\n"
"* **uniques** huma kemm nies differenti għamlu dawk il-pageviews: kull membru dieħel jingħadd darba, u kull viżitatur mhux dieħel darba għal kull indirizz u browser.\n"
"* **subscriptions** huwa n-numru ta' abbonamenti ġodda li ġew iġġenerati f'ġurnata partikolari. Dan in-numru huwa inqas preċiż mill-ewwel żewġ metriċi, għax, għalkemm nistgħu nsegwu l-abbonamenti l-ġodda, m'għandna l-ebda mod kif insegwu t-tneħħija tal-abbonamenti.\n"
"\n"
"Nota: hemm ftit postijiet barra l-vault tiegħek fejn xi ħadd jista' jikklikkja \"abbona\", għalhekk huwa possibbli (għalkemm improbabbli) li n-numru tal-abbonamenti jaqbeż in-numru tal-uniques f'ġurnata partikolari.\n"

