msgstr "stedina biex  timmodera %(url)s"

#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:62
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**gadzooks! you are invited to become a moderator of [%(title)s](%(url)s)!**\n"
"\n"
"*to accept*, visit the [moderators page for %(url)s](%(url)s/about/moderators) and click \"accept\".\n"
"\n"
"*otherwise,* if you did not expect to receive this, you can simply ignore this invitation or report it.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"*Before accepting, we encourage you to review our [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) to understand the expectations and responsibilities of being a moderator.*"
msgstr ""
"**ara ara! ġejt mistieden issir moderatur ta' [%(title)s](%(url)s)!**\n"
"\n"
"*biex taċċetta*, żur il-[paġna tal-moderaturi għal %(url)s](%(url)s/about/moderators) u kklikkja \"aċċetta\".\n"
"\n"
"*inkella,* jekk ma kontx qed tistenna li tirċievi dan, tista' sempliċement tinjora din l-istedina jew tirrapportaha.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"*Qabel ma taċċetta, nħeġġuk tirrevedi l-[Linji Gwida għall-Moderaturi](/help/moderatorguidelines) tagħna biex tifhem l-aspettattivi u r-responsabbiltajiet ta' moderatur.*"

#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:70
msgid "moderator invited"
msgstr "moderatur mistieden"

#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:71
#, python-format
