msgstr "%(user)s ġie mistieden minn %(author)s sabiex jimmodera %(url)s."

#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:77
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Congratulations!** You have accepted the invitation to moderate [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Welcome to the Tippr Moderator Community!\n"
"\n"
"As a moderator, you play a vital role in building and maintaining our community. Here are some important things to know:\n"
"\n"
"### Your Responsibilities\n"
"\n"
"- Enforce vault rules and site-wide policies\n"
"- Foster a welcoming environment for community members\n"
"- Review reports and take appropriate action\n"
"- Collaborate with fellow moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Important Resources\n"
"\n"
"- [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Learn about best practices and expectations\n"
"- [Content Policy](/help/contentpolicy) - Understand site-wide rules\n"
"- [User Agreement](/help/useragreement) - Know the terms of service\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Connect with other moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Volunteer Status\n"
"\n"
"Please note that moderators are independent volunteers, not employees of Tippr. For more details, please review the [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for helping make Tippr a great place!"
msgstr ""
"**Prosit!** Aċċettajt l-istedina biex timmodera [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Merħba fil-Komunità tal-Moderaturi ta' Tippr!\n"
"\n"
"Bħala moderatur, għandek rwol essenzjali fil-bini u ż-żamma tal-komunità tagħna. Hawn xi affarijiet importanti li għandek tkun taf:\n"
"\n"
"### Ir-Responsabbiltajiet Tiegħek\n"
"\n"
"- Applika r-regoli tal-vault u l-politiki tas-sit kollu\n"
"- Rawwem ambjent akkoljenti għall-membri tal-komunità\n"
"- Irrevedi r-rapporti u ħu l-azzjoni xierqa\n"
"- Ikkollabora mal-moderaturi sħabek\n"
"\n"
"### Riżorsi Importanti\n"
"\n"
"- [Linji Gwida għall-Moderaturi](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Tgħallem dwar l-aħjar prattiki u l-aspettattivi\n"
"- [Politika tal-Kontenut](/help/contentpolicy) - Ifhem ir-regoli tas-sit kollu\n"
"- [Ftehim mal-Utenti](/help/useragreement) - Kun af it-termini tas-servizz\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Ikkomunika ma' moderaturi oħra\n"
"\n"
"### Status ta' Voluntier\n"
"\n"
"Jekk jogħġbok innota li l-moderaturi huma voluntiera indipendenti, mhux impjegati ta' Tippr. Għal aktar dettalji, jekk jogħġbok irrevedi l-[Linji Gwida għall-Moderaturi](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Grazzi talli qed tgħin biex Tippr ikun post mill-aqwa!"

