msgstr "Google Cloud console: APIs & Services, Credentials, oħloq OAuth client ID (web application) u żid dan bħala authorized redirect URI. L-ewwel issettja l-OAuth consent screen (scopes: email, profile, openid)."

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:65
