msgstr "GitHub, Settings, Developer settings, OAuth Apps: irreġistra OAuth app ġdida (mhux GitHub App) b'dan bħala l-authorization callback URL tagħha. Il-client ID tagħha jintwera hemm; iġġenera client secret fl-istess paġna."

#: r2/templates/adminloginsettings.html:69
msgid "Discord Developer Portal: create an application, then under OAuth2 add this as a redirect. The client ID and client secret (reset it to see one) are on the same page."
msgstr "Discord Developer Portal: oħloq application, imbagħad taħt OAuth2 żid dan bħala redirect. Il-client ID u l-client secret (agħmel reset biex tara wieħed) jinsabu fl-istess paġna."

