msgstr "Ħareġ ukoll pre-release:"

#: r2/templates/adminserverstatus.html:56
msgid "Read the release's notes before updating: anything that needs doing by hand is in them."
msgstr "Aqra n-noti tar-rilaxx qabel ma taġġorna: kull ma jrid isir bl-idejn jinsab fihom."

#: r2/templates/adminserverstatus.html:63
