#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:96
msgid "The site counts its own traffic for the traffic pages (/traffic, and each vault's traffic stats) without any outside service. To use Google Analytics as well, paste its measurement ID (G-…, or the whole tag Google gives you). It isn't loaded for visitors whose browser asks not to be tracked. In some places (the EU and UK, for example) you need visitors' consent before using it; the privacy policy already says the site may use analytics."
msgstr "Is-sit jgħodd it-traffiku tiegħu stess għall-paġni tat-traffiku (/traffic, u l-istatistika tat-traffiku ta' kull vault) mingħajr ebda servizz minn barra. Biex tuża wkoll Google Analytics, waħħal l-ID tal-kejl tiegħu (G-…, jew it-tag kollu li jagħtik Google). Ma jitgħabbiex għal viżitaturi li l-browser tagħhom jitlob li ma jiġux segwiti. F'xi postijiet (l-UE u r-Renju Unit, pereżempju) teħtieġ il-kunsens tal-viżitaturi qabel tużah; il-politika tal-privatezza diġà tgħid li s-sit jista' juża l-analitika."

