msgstr "paġni tal-politika"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:120
msgid "The user agreement, privacy policy, content policy and moderator guidelines start from the templates in docs/policies, filled in with the site name, domain and these two; where they say how to reach you, they link to sections of the contact page (/contact), which offers a message to the admins and the contact address above when it is set. They're wiki pages: edit them at /wiki/useragreement and so on. To rebuild them from the templates after changing these (this replaces any edits):"
msgstr "Il-ftehim mal-utenti, il-politika tal-privatezza, il-politika tal-kontenut u l-linji gwida għall-moderaturi jibdew mill-mudelli f'docs/policies, mimlija bl-isem tas-sit, id-dominju u dawn it-tnejn; fejn jgħidu kif jikkuntattjawk, jorbtu ma' taqsimiet tal-paġna tal-kuntatt (/contact), li toffri messaġġ lill-amministraturi u l-indirizz tal-kuntatt ta' hawn fuq meta jkun issettjat. Huma paġni wiki: editjahom f'/wiki/useragreement u l-bqija. Biex terġa' tibnihom mill-mudelli wara li tbiddel dawn (dan jissostitwixxi kull editjar):"

